tests/

# Documentation only. Scoped to the context root on purpose: the seed corpora
# under data/ are Markdown too, and AUTO_SEED cannot rebuild the network
# without them. A bare `*.md` relies on `*` not crossing a `/` to spare them —
# true under Go's filepath.Match, but far too subtle to rest a deploy on.
/*.md

# Belt and braces: never exclude the corpora, whatever is added above.
!data/demo_corpus/
!data/marketplace_corpus/
